<div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div><h1 class="h3 mb-1">Mangrove clusters</h1><p class="text-muted mb-0">Inspect each verified monitoring area and open its observation timeline.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-success" href="<?= e(url('admin/analytics.php')) ?>">Analytics map</a></div>
